   "stem_html": "A major misstep in President Wilson’s promotion of his peace plan after World War I was his",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1171837,
     "content_html": "failing to invite any Republicans or members of the Senate to the Versailles Peace Conference"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171836,
     "content_html": "publicly outlining his Fourteen Points peace plan"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171835,
     "content_html": "asking Congress for a declaration of war in 1917"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171834,
     "content_html": "travelling overseas to attend the Versailles Peace Conference"
    }
